  "goodToKnow": "Die Majestät is feminine even when it refers to a king: Seine Majestät der König. Ihre Majestät die Königin is the form of address for a queen. Direct address: Eure Majestät (your majesty). The adjective is majestätisch, and the word also describes nature: die Majestät des Hochgebirges. The offence of Majestätsbeleidigung (insulting a foreign head of state, §103 of the criminal code) was repealed with effect from 2018."
